OL,3,GNEWSATwelve arrested in organised crime
OL,4,Araids
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been arrested in a
OL,7,Fseries of police raids across Hull as
OL,8,Fpart of a crackdown on organised drugs
OL,9,Fcrime.
OL,11,FSearches took place at Wenlock Street,
OL,12,FBentley Street, Constable Street and a
OL,13,Fboat docked at the city's marina,
OL,14,FHumberside Police said.
OL,16,FThree men, aged 50, 45 and 31, two
OL,17,F38-year-old men, two 22-year-old men
OL,18,Fand a 44-year-old woman were arrested
OL,19,Fon suspicion of being concerned in the
OL,20,Fsupply of class A drugs and remain in
OL,21,Fpolice custody. The four other suspects
OL,22,Fwere released on conditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
